Task: 
Launch a container using the image valkyrie-prod:v0.0.1.
You need to map the host’s port 8080 to port 8080 on the container.
Add & to the end of the command to cause the container to run in the background.
When your container is running you will see the page by Web Preview.



Code:

# Build image with your specific tag
docker build -t valkyrie-prod:v0.0.2 .

# Run test container in background, mapping port 8080.
docker run -p 8080:8080 valkyrie-prod:v0.0.2 &

//You can optionally use the Web Preview feature on port 8080 in Cloud Shell to see your app running live before proceeding.
